# Git Commit Message Convention
# Format: <type>(<scope>): <description>
#
# Types:
#   feat     - New feature
#   fix      - Bug fix
#   refactor - Code refactoring (no behavior change)
#   chore    - Maintenance tasks (migrations, seeders, config)
#   docs     - Documentation
#   test     - Tests
#   style    - Code formatting (Pint, ESLint)
#
# Scopes:
#   comanda, jornada, catalogo, inventario, clientes,
#   sistema, auth, reportes, seeders, routes, config
#
# Examples:
#   feat(comanda): add product note field
#   fix(jornada): save monto_inicial on open
#   chore(seeder): add permiso_rol seeder
#
# Rules:
#   - Max 72 chars for subject line
#   - Use imperative mood ("add" not "added")
#   - Reference issues with #issue-number
